{
  "name": "Dragon's Blood",
  "description": "Overlord Mutare, an ambitious Nighon Lady, wishes to take her rightful place among the ranks of powerful Nighon Lords.  In Nighon, you don't inherit your lands - you take them from those too weak to hold them.  Only the strong are fit to rule, and the bones of the weak litter the tunnels of Nighon.",
