      "mapName": "DB3 Blood of the Dragon Father.h3m",
      "regionText": "Whoever gains the Vial of Dragon Blood and drinks the Blood of the Dragon Father with transform into a Sentient Dragon.  You MUST beat Ordwald to the Vial and defeat its guardians.  Nothing else matters.  Nothing!",
      "prologText": "I have found Ordwald.  He is close to the vial, but his conservative actions and slow thinking leaves the way open for me to surpass him.  As much as I must worry about Ordwald, I must consider the vial.  Once I have passed him, there is the vial, and no doubt, it will have guardians... dragon guardians.",
